From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:29:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): Material 3 settings sub-pages and update-safe auto
 backups

- Host MainActivity on Theme.Material3Expressive.DynamicColors.DayNight
  with a preferenceTheme overlay: settings sub-pages (Global Options,
  Advanced, statistics, ...) render as rounded MD3 surface-container
  cards with MD3 typography, headers and 64dp toolbar. The IME and the
  other activities keep their existing themes.
- Resolve theme colors through a ColorStateList-tolerant helper, because
  MD3 maps android:textColorSecondary etc. to a ColorStateList which the
  previous code rejected (crash on the home page under MD3).
- Back up shared prefs and databases once per version upgrade, keep the
  three newest ZIPs, and add Settings > Advanced rows to inspect and
  restore the latest backup, so settings, clipboard history and typing
  statistics survive future updates.
- Pluralize statistics counts (characters/corrections/days) and clarify
  the corrected-character summary.

Built as 0.1.3-patchwork (versionCode 11209, arm64-v8a) and verified on
a OnePlus PJF110 running Android 15.
